    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="14">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 14</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ælc cyricgrið binnan wagum ⁊ cyninges handgrið efen unwemme.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every right of sanctuary within the walls of a church, and the protection granted by the king in person shall remain equally inviolate.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
